          "text": "<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-2em\">Program objectives</span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Evaluate and diagnose infection&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Evaluate extensile approaches and implant removal&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Determine implant selection for reimplantation&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Discuss post-operative management&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ul>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Feb 06 2024 19:35:13 GMT+0000",
